<p>16<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH16.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Purchasing. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Purchasing</a></p>

<p>17<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH17.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Commissioner of Health. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Commissioner of Health</a></p>

<p>18<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH18.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Budget and Tax Levy. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Budget and Tax Levy</a></p>

<p>19<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH19.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Taxation and Assessment. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Taxation and Assessment</a></p>

<p>20<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH20.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Miscellaneous Provisions. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Miscellaneous Provisions</a></p>

<p>22<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH22.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Police and Fire Departments. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Police and Fire Departments</a></p>

<p>34<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH34.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Firemen's Annuity and Benefit Fund. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Firemen's Annuity and Benefit Fund</a></p>

