<p>36 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/CH36.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Employes' Retirement System. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Employes' Retirement System</a></p>

<p><a href="https://city.milwaukee.gov/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/City-Charter/Appendix.pdf?" linktype="3" target="_blank" aria-label="Appendix. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Appendix</a></p>

