Regulatory Ordinances</h2>

<p>50 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH50.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="General Provisions. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">General Provisions</a></p>

<p>59 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH59.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Health Department. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Health Department</a></p>

<p>60<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH60.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Health - Related Fees. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Health - Related Fees</a></p>

<p>61<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH61.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Penalties for Health - Related Violations. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Penalties for Health - Related Violations</a></p>

<p>62 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH62.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Communicable Diseases. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Communicable Diseases</a></p>

<p>63 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH63.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Parks and Parkways. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Parks and Parkways</a></p>

<p>64<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH64.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Campgrounds. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Campgrounds</a></p>

<p>66 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH66.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Toxic and Hazardous Substances. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Toxic and Hazardous Substances</a></p>

<p>68 <a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH68.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Food License Regulations. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window">Food License Regulations</a></p>

<p>73<a href="/ImageLibrary/Groups/ccClerk/Ordinances/Volume-1/CH73.pdf" linktype="4" target="_blank" aria-label="Ice and Water Regulations. Opens a PDF Document. Opens in a new window"> Ice and Water Regulations</a></p>

